      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHEAT CODE (5) finds it hard to break through. Has finished in the money at the last three runs. Has a good record here including three wins. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Good form should continue. SPRING DIESEL (7) turned in a plain performance last time when fifth at this track over 300m behind Sketchy Toby (17.54) in a Grade 4/5. Was in the money the start prior. Has ability and is one of the better chances. FREYA LEGEND (8) is progressing well and looks close to another win after hitting the frame last run (16.82) at this track. Strike rate this course and distance strong having won six of eight tries. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Expected to be in the finish again. IF I COULD (4) jumped best and was never headed last time. Big chance again.",
